### Crear albarán
POST https://repoprograwebservidor-production.up.railway.app/api/deliveryNote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "client": "69ef81274f98f406c641b41d",
    "project": "69ef81274f98f406c641b421",
    "format": "material",
    "description": "Materia",
    "quantity": "2",
    "signature": null
}

### Firmar (actualizar) un albarán y también subir una foto del albarán firmado
PATCH https://repoprograwebservidor-production.up.railway.app/api/deliveryNote/69f07a50804418f096e0315b
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="signature"; filename="signed_image.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./signed_image.png
------WebKitFormBoundary--


### Obtener todos los albaranes (con filtros)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/deliveryNote?company=69f07a0f804418f096e03153
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener un albarán por ID
GET https://repoprograwebservidor-production.up.railway.app/api/deliveryNote/69ef81284f98f406c641b425
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Borrar un albarán (aquí no hay soft delete)
DELETE https://repoprograwebservidor-production.up.railway.app/api/deliveryNote/69ef81284f98f406c641b425
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Descargar un albarán en PDF
GET https://repoprograwebservidor-production.up.railway.app/api/deliveryNote/pdf/69ef81284f98f406c641b425
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/pdf


